--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project is a port of pyside6-webusb (also MIT-licensed; see its own
LICENSE file for its copyright notice) to a Firefox-extension-based
architecture. Substantial portions of native-host/src/fox_webusb_host/
(hardening.py, errors.py) and native/fox_webusb_accel/ are carried over from
that project with only naming/documentation changes.

This project depends on, but does not redistribute:
  - pyusb (Apache License 2.0) -- installed separately via pip; see
    native-host/pyproject.toml.
  - pyo3 and the base64 crate (dual MIT/Apache-2.0) -- only pulled in if you
    choose to build the optional native/fox_webusb_accel/ Rust extension;
    see its Cargo.toml. Not built or bundled by default.

Unlike pyside6-webusb, this project does not bundle or depend on Qt/PySide6
at all -- there is nothing Qt-licensed in this repository or its runtime
dependencies.
